              'text': 'Worktree and Shell Mode Shortcuts: Press ⌘⌥O on macOS or Ctrl+Alt+O on Windows and Linux to choose a worktree, and ⌘⌥B or Ctrl+Alt+B to choose its base branch. ⌘⇧X or Ctrl+Shift+X now toggles shell mode in the composer',
